<title>INDIA: Bombay bourse holidays for 1997 - BSE.</title>
<headline>Bombay bourse holidays for 1997 - BSE.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following list of holidays for 1997 has been issued by the Bombay Stock Exchange:</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>HOLIDAY			    DATE		 DAY OF WEEK</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Republic Day		     26th January     Sunday</p>
<p>Id-ul-Fitra (Ramzan Id)	 9th February    Sunday</p>
<p>Mahashivratri		     7th March	 Friday</p>
<p>Holi(2nd day)		    24th March	 Monday</p>
<p>Gudi Padwa			  8th April	 Tuesday</p>
<p>Dr. Babasaheb Ambedkar</p>
<p>  Jayanti			  14th April	 Monday</p>
<p>Ram Navami			 16th April	 Wednesday</p>
<p>Id-ul-Zuha (Bakri Id)	  18th April	 Friday</p>
<p>Mahavir Jayanti		  20th April	 Sunday</p>
<p>Maharastra Day		    1st May	   Thursday</p>
<p>Chhatrapati Shivaji Jayanti   8th May	   Thursday</p>
<p>Moharram			   18th May	   Sunday</p>
<p>Independence Day		 15th August	Friday</p>
